# Root build context for docker/Dockerfile (see its header). Keep the context
# to what the image builds need: the service modules, commands/ and internal/.
# Anything a per-service .dockerignore used to exclude is excluded here with a
# ** prefix.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
tools
smelt
go.work
go.work.sum
Makefile
**/dist
**/.env*
**/*.md
**/.goreleaser.yaml
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/compose*.yml
**/LICENSE
**/config.example.yaml
**/version.json
**/.idea
**/.dockerignore
